WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,540
Fish goes in and oil comes out

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,940
Is this cage broken?

3
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:06,020
The blade of Su Che with props inside

4
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:07,060
We don't have this

5
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,460
And it also released the ear

6
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:11,230
This Su Che

7
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:12,460
I know it's bad

8
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,760
Didn't even remind me

9
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,720
Deliberately give up an hour

10
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,020
But we picked it up ourselves

11
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:23,280
They didn’t seem to say it could be picked up.

12
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,280
It doesn't want it

13
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,880
When you get back, tell us that we caught him.

14
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:32,520
Anyway, fish can be eaten

15
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,960
You are here to survive on a desert island

16
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:38,650
Even if it tastes bad, you have to eat fish.

17
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:39,570
But not baked

18
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,570
Su Che is making soup and adding salt

19
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,120
It even made salt

20
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,480
What's so great about salt

21
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,040
Isn’t the sea water full of salt?

22
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,040
We will do it tomorrow too
